[{"code":"list_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":11,"col":19},"end":{"line":11,"col":30}},"title":"LIST MAY BE SHARED","message":"`[ …acc, x ]` adds to the end of `acc` itself, and the function that does it\ngoes where the checker cannot see every call of it: it is returned.\n\n11|pusher acc = λx → [ …acc, x ]\n                     ^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n\nTo be safe, change a copy:\n\n11|pusher acc = λx → [ …List.copy acc, x ]\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: a call it cannot see may\nhand the function a list something else still holds."}]
